    "enUS": {
      "description": "You've done enough here, {class}. I'll stay and clean up any stragglers down there.\r\n\r\nHead back to the Village and tell Rorian about the cult's presence. He will not be pleased.",
      "summary": "Bring word of the Al'Aketh to Rorian the Dayseeker in Thendal Grove.",
      "title": "Return to Rorian",
